# SE-012: Extraction recovery should depend on phase ratio rather than batch scale
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 naphthalene 0.000002mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 naphthalene 0.000004mol
new
new
extract v1 v3 hexane 10mL
extract v2 v4 hexane 20mL
inspect
